{"id":"n5-131","title":"まだ～ません","romaji":"mada ~masen","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that something has not happened or been done yet (polite form).","longExplanation":"The まだ～ません grammar point is used to express that something has not happened or been done yet in a polite register. It is used with the negative ます-form of a verb (～ません). まだ is placed before the verb phrase.","formation":"まだ + Verb-ます form (negative)","examples":[{"jp":"昼ご飯をまだ食べていません。","romaji":"Hirugohan o mada tabete imasen.","en":"I have not eaten lunch yet.","words":[{"surface":"昼ご飯","vocabId":"1602340","reading":"ひるごはん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"食べていません","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべていません","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"宿題がまだ終わっていません。","romaji":"Shukudai ga mada owatte imasen.","en":"I have not finished my homework yet.","words":[{"surface":"宿題","vocabId":"1337270","reading":"しゅくだい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"終わっていません","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわっていません","baseForm":"終わる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"東京にはまだ行ったことがありません。","romaji":"Toukyou ni wa mada itta koto ga arimasen.","en":"I have not been to Tokyo yet.","words":[{"surface":"東京","vocabId":"1447690","reading":"とうきょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"行った","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなった","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼はまだ来ていません。","romaji":"Kare wa mada kite imasen.","en":"He hasn't come yet.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"来ていません","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きていません","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]}],"kind":"construction"}